<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Infrastructure Runbook — Meridian Internal</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/meridian.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container py-5">
    <h1 class="h4 mb-1">Infrastructure Runbook</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">Meridian Internal — Platform Admin (<%= admin.email %>)</p>

    <div class="mdn-card p-4 mb-3">
      <h2 class="h6">Core routing service</h2>
      <p class="mb-0">Connection pool ceiling: 512 per region. Escalation: page the platform on-call rotation if p99 latency exceeds 2s for more than 5 minutes. Failover runbook: drain the affected region via the traffic manager, then redeploy with the previous known-good image tag.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mdn-card p-4 mb-3">
      <h2 class="h6">Primary database cluster</h2>
      <p class="mb-0">Replicas: 2 read replicas per region, async replication. Failover is manual and requires two-person approval. Backup cadence: continuous WAL archiving plus nightly base backups retained for 35 days.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mdn-card p-4">
      <h2 class="h6">Partner API rate limiting</h2>
      <p class="mb-0">Default ceiling: 600 requests/minute per credential. Contact the platform team before raising a partner's limit above the default.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
